      "id": "clm:61ec77c48b205d0452ca418bf1638c4d89ae73656133075ef41d2c29a5faf046",
      "text": "The complete inspected Handle body calls the required transactional-store methods directly. It contains no optional fallback to the ordinary Store interface and no type assertion to MongoSessionProvider. It supplies no checkpoint operation or projection implementation. That selected body and the shown signature comparison do not demonstrate a working store adapter or a combined marker/projection/checkpoint crash-replay protocol. (medium confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rbaliyan/event/b112463682d44b0e57d8545e3cdf5d51e112e914/transaction/handler.go",
