    {
      "id": "clm:44b6271ce306caad2fbb00ca67cca19ada80917707ef2a9e0b84f8c330422e77",
      "text": "TransactionalStore embeds Store and requires IsDuplicateTx(ctx context.Context, tx any, messageID string) (bool, error) and MarkProcessedTx(ctx context.Context, tx any, messageID string) error. Its transaction-object parameter is part of each required method signature. (low confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rbaliyan/event/b112463682d44b0e57d8545e3cdf5d51e112e914/idempotency/store.go",
      "also": [],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:04ea46314f59c92f2d0eebfef1c101a64e40b62026d63edc3bdc23e429d86956"
      ],
      "temporal": {
        "applicability_version": "event-mongodb@ca444aedec31e7e959c0932a8f7577c15312f37e; declared github.com/rbaliyan/event/v3 v3.18.1; event@b112463682d44b0e57d8545e3cdf5d51e112e914",
        "recorded_at": "2026-11-02T15:09:47.664124+00:00"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:d9a82f53c4afbe0a1c00c16c4c89e293de40aea9bd788ec00b4a71be1273b493",
      "text": "The Handle method of TransactionalHandler computes a key and calls h.txManager.Execute with the outer ctx. Inside its transaction callback it passes that captured ctx and the callback tx to IsDuplicateTx, the user handler and MarkProcessedTx. A duplicate-check error returns before user handling; a duplicate skips user handling and marking; a user-handler error returns before marking. Otherwise the callback returns the marker result. (low confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rbaliyan/event/b112463682d44b0e57d8545e3cdf5d51e112e914/transaction/handler.go",
      "also": [],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:185943819f0900cde3a8d998cfe073a3dfc8af05fb6e801e02d845d5d05ffe68"
      ],
      "temporal": {
        "applicability_version": "event-mongodb@ca444aedec31e7e959c0932a8f7577c15312f37e; declared github.com/rbaliyan/event/v3 v3.18.1; event@b112463682d44b0e57d8545e3cdf5d51e112e914",
        "recorded_at": "2026-11-02T15:09:47.664124+00:00"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:c282c90d1465a172a59dfdfa1dd2ba401b696398c8bf8d8114e2d7d615e6d62d",
      "text": "The pinned event-mongodb dependency manifest declares github.com/rbaliyan/event/v3 v3.18.1. The supplied GitHub response requested for that declared release tag returns the upstream commit used by the immutable source bodies in this comparison. (medium confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rbaliyan/event-mongodb/ca444aedec31e7e959c0932a8f7577c15312f37e/go.mod",
