    },
    {
      "id": "clm:5198dda3a3d58f28725282964ffdee0e86624d77d9bdbd58949b1053eead8229",
      "text": "NewTransactionalHandler accepts a handler callback with context.Context, Transaction and data, a Manager, an idempotency.TransactionalStore, and a key function returning string. The constructor stores these arguments directly in the returned TransactionalHandler. (low confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rbaliyan/event/b112463682d44b0e57d8545e3cdf5d51e112e914/transaction/handler.go",
      "also": [],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:d1f5b8a8a56d650a093bab943d54defc934c911bb2f62357dbf52806708fc00d"
      ],
      "temporal": {
        "applicability_version": "event-mongodb@ca444aedec31e7e959c0932a8f7577c15312f37e; declared github.com/rbaliyan/event/v3 v3.18.1; event@b112463682d44b0e57d8545e3cdf5d51e112e914",
        "recorded_at": "2026-11-02T15:09:47.664124+00:00"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:6a77513cb023c409bf033564e6a78f7b6aca811a598b272f32dc5b467324bd76",
      "text": "The shown MongoStore methods IsDuplicateTx and MarkProcessedTx take context and message ID; neither has the transaction-object parameter required by TransactionalStore. Their signatures therefore do not match that interface's required Tx methods. The MongoStore source declares a compile-time assertion for evtidempotency.Store; that assertion supplies no TransactionalStore assertion. (high confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rbaliyan/event/b112463682d44b0e57d8545e3cdf5d51e112e914/idempotency/store.go",
      "also": [
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rbaliyan/event-mongodb/ca444aedec31e7e959c0932a8f7577c15312f37e/idempotency/mongodb.go"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:04ea46314f59c92f2d0eebfef1c101a64e40b62026d63edc3bdc23e429d86956",
        "ev:27da6458b8fd30b92751992982b1d423c05566eca59b093eacc81bf9a81f1f1d",
        "ev:acbe65fa636d44cab80a4377739f618d9a2d9cff26bf3a34bab9c7bf7f696560",
        "ev:af560df4cb027abd0b33bcaf009b5a059aa62d5f908dd798dac10c2055ae801a"
      ],
      "temporal": {
        "applicability_version": "event-mongodb@ca444aedec31e7e959c0932a8f7577c15312f37e; declared github.com/rbaliyan/event/v3 v3.18.1; event@b112463682d44b0e57d8545e3cdf5d51e112e914",
        "recorded_at": "2026-11-02T15:09:47.664124+00:00"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:3d720386850bf50687aad64e228ef3039d05decacab5e5f06c8b2086ed22f745",
      "text": "In this handler-to-manager path, the Execute method of MongoManager constructs a MongoTransaction containing the driver callback context and passes that wrapper to fn. The Handle method still supplies its captured outer context alongside that transaction object. Transaction exposes Commit and Rollback, while MongoSessionProvider additionally exposes Session and Context. The Context method returns the stored context; passing the outer handler context unchanged does not itself perform that accessor handoff. (high confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rbaliyan/event/b112463682d44b0e57d8545e3cdf5d51e112e914/transaction/handler.go",
      "also": [
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rbaliyan/event/b112463682d44b0e57d8545e3cdf5d51e112e914/transaction/manager.go",
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rbaliyan/event-mongodb/ca444aedec31e7e959c0932a8f7577c15312f37e/transaction/mongodb.go"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
